Now JavelinEvent parameterization for shotput. Current constructor super(game,'javelin'). Modify with options:
```
const id=options.id||'javelin';
super(game,id,options);
this.worldMode='javelin';
this.optAngle=options.optAngle??36;
this.angleAmp=options.angleAmp??16;
this.base=options.base??62; this.span=options.span??31; this.max=options.max??93.4;
this.isShot = id==='shotput';
```
Use optAngle and values in update/tap/hud/result/clamp, jumbo, camera, draw hooks.

Let's patch all hardcoded.

