Let me code with deterministic peak positions. For layer k, generate N peaks. Use seeded. Build path: start (-20, baseline). For i peaks: peakX, peakY = baseline - amp*(0.6+r*0.9). Line to peak, then down to valley = baseline - amp*0.15. Continue. close to bottom.

